{"stamp": "1790717009793509998-774427", "tool": "lean_verify_edit", "exit": 0, "arguments": {"path": "Mathlib/GroupTheory/GroupAction/DomAct/ActionHom.lean", "line_start": 9, "line_end": 20, "replacement": "public import Mathlib.GroupTheory.GroupAction.Hom\n\nset_option linter.style.longLine true\n\n/-!\n# Action of `Mᵈᵐᵃ` on `α →[N] β` and `A →+[N] B`\n\nIn this file we define action of `DomMulAct M = Mᵈᵐᵃ` on `α →[N] β` and on `A →+[N] B`. At the\ntime of writing, these homomorphisms are not widely used in the library, so we put these instances\ninto a separate file, not with the definition of `DomMulAct`.\n\n## TODO\n\nAdd left actions of, e.g., `M` on `α →[N] β` to `Mathlib/GroupTheory/GroupAction/Hom.lean` and\n`SMulCommClass` instances saying that left and right actions commute."}, "result": {"mode": "verified_edit", "success": true, "errors_introduced": 0, "errors_already": 0, "environment_reviewed": false}}
